  "description": "\u201cThe perspector of the outward equilateral triangles erected on sides BC, CA, AB, minimizing PA + PB + PC when all angles less than 120\u00b0.\u201d\n\u2014 Clark Kimberling's Encyclopedia of Triangle Centers (ETC) \u2022 X_13 (1st Isogonic Center (Fermat Point))\n\nInteractive GEOMETOR Explorer page: https://geometor.github.io/etc/centers/c-00001-00019/x-00013/\n\n1 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: X_13 = 1st Isogonic (Fermat) Center \u2022 [A A'] \u2229 [B B'] \u2229 [C C']\n2 \u00b7 GOAL: X_13 = 1st Isogonic (Fermat) Center \u2022 [A A'] \u2229 [B B'] \u2229 [C C']\n3 \u00b7 ASSERT: Trilinears csc(A + \u03c0/3) : csc(B + \u03c0/3) : csc(C + \u03c0/3)\n4 \u00b7 INTERSECT: Lines {2, 13, 16} \u2022 {3, 13, 17} \u2022 {5, 13, 18} \u2022 {6, 13, 14}\n5 \u00b7 INTERSECT: Lines {2, 13, 16} \u2022 {3, 13, 17} \u2022 {5, 13, 18} \u2022 {6, 13, 14}\n6 \u00b7 PROVE: Isogonal Conjugate X_15 (1st Isodynamic) \u2022 Inverse X_14\n7 \u00b7 \u2234: Kimberling (6, 9, 13) Search = 0.075945151805\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 ETC \u2022 X_13",
